  "paragraphs": [
    "Cincinnati and Dayton’s Established Eyelid Experts",
    "35+ years of combined experience",
    "25,000 + eyelid and brow surgeries performed",
    "You Deserve to feel confident",
    "At AestheticEye, we are committed to excellence, focusing on oculofacial plastic surgery to deliver the highest quality of care. Our comprehensive services in Cincinnati and Dayton, include cosmetic and reconstructive eyelid surgeries, as well as non-surgical treatments designed to enhance your natural beauty and improve your vision and comfort.",
    "About our practice",
    "Welcome to AestheticEye, the premier oculoplastic surgery practice in Cincinnati and Dayton, OH, led by the highly skilled Dr. Ginger Henson and Dr. Jonathan Pargament. As board-certified and nationally recognized oculoplastic surgeons, Dr. Henson and Dr. Pargament bring unparalleled expertise and specialized training to performing both aesthetic and reconstructive surgery for the eyelids and face.",
    "Correcting drooping upper eyelids is one of our specialties. This procedure, known as blepharoplasty, can significantly improve your field of vision and provide a more youthful and alert appearance.",
    "We offer advanced techniques to address lower eyelid bags and puffiness, rejuvenating your under-eye area and creating a refreshed look.",
    "Our brow and forehead lift procedures elevate sagging brows and smooth out deep forehaed lines, offering a rejuvenated and more youthful appearance.",
    "View Our Gallery",
    "Regain control over your impressions",
    "Dr. Ginger Henson and Dr. Jonathan Pargament have distinguished backgrounds, with extensive training and experience in oculoplastic surgery. Their commitment to patient-centered care and use of the latest surgical techniques ensure that you receive the highest standard of care at AestheticEye.",
    "Improving your vision",
    "At AestheticEye, we understand the importance of your eyes in expressing your individuality and enhancing your overall appearance. Our personalized approach to care, state-of-the-art facilities, and compassionate team make us the leading choice for oculoplastic surgery in Cincinnati and Dayton.",
    "Reconstructive Surgery Procedures",
    "Looking as happy as you feel",
    "In addition to surgical options, AestheticEye offers a range of non-surgical treatments to rejuvenate your appearance. These include chemical peels, injectables, and fillers for upper eyelid hollows, designed to enhance your look with minimal downtime.",
    "Non-Surgical Treatments",
    "Begin Your Transormation",
    "Take the first step towards rejuvenating your eyes and enhancing your natural beauty. Contact AestheticEye today to schedule a consultation with Dr. Henson or Dr. Pargament and discover the possibilities of our specialized oculoplastic procedures.",
    "Oct 01, 2026",
    "A bulging eye, new double vision, eye-socket pressure, or unexplained vision changes can be orbital tumor symptoms, but they can also result from thyroid eye disease, inflammation, infection, vascular disorders,… Continue reading about Are a Bulging Eye or Double Vision Possible Orbital Tumor Symptoms?",
    "Sep 15, 2026",
    "Most eyelid bumps aren’t serious, but if you notice a lump that keeps coming back, changes, bleeds, affects your lashes, or makes it harder to move your eyelid, it’s time… Continue reading about When Should an Eyelid Bump Be Checked by an Oculoplastic Surgeon?",
    "Aug 11, 2026",
    "Revision eyelid surgery may be worth considering when problems from a previous eyelid procedure remain after healing or interfere with eye comfort, closure, vision, or appearance. A second operation isn’t… Continue reading about When Should You Consider Revision Eyelid Surgery?"
  ],
